{"title": "Presley Gerber, Son of Cindy Crawford, Dies at 27", "summary": "Presley Gerber, the 27-year-old son of models Cindy Crawford and Rande Gerber, has died. He was at a rehabilitation facility at the time of his death. The cause of death has not yet been revealed. Gerber had previously spoken about his struggles with mental health and addiction. His mother, Cindy Crawford, is reportedly heartbroken.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "सिंडी क्रॉफर्ड के बेटे प्रेस्ली गेर्बर का 27 साल की उम्र में निधन", "summary_hi": "मॉडल सिंडी क्रॉफर्ड और रेंडे गेर्बर के 27 वर्षीय बेटे प्रेस्ली गेर्बर का निधन हो गया है। मृत्यु के समय वह एक पुनर्वास सुविधा में थे। मृत्यु का कारण अभी तक सामने नहीं आया है। गेर्बर ने पहले मानसिक स्वास्थ्य और नशे की लत से अपने संघर्षों के बारे में खुलकर बात की थी। उनकी मां, सिंडी क्रॉफर्ड, कथित तौर पर दिल से दुखी हैं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Highlights Cindy Crawford's \"heartbreaking words\" to her son months before his death.", "Notes that Presley Gerber was at a rehabilitation facility when he died."], "center": ["Reports that Presley Gerber was at a rehabilitation facility at the time of his death.", "Mentions that the cause of death has not yet been revealed.", "Notes that Gerber had previously spoken openly about his struggles with mental health and addiction.", "Includes details about Presley Gerber's final photos revealing happy family memories with his mother.", "States that a family representative confirmed his death."], "right": ["Emphasizes that the cause of death is unknown.", "States that Presley Gerber, son of Cindy Crawford and Rande Gerber, is dead at 27."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["उनकी मृत्यु से कुछ महीने पहले सिंडी क्रॉफर्ड के अपने बेटे के लिए \"दिल तोड़ने वाले शब्द\" पर प्रकाश डालता है।", "नोट करता है कि प्रेस्ली गेर्बर की मृत्यु के समय वह एक पुनर्वास सुविधा में थे।"], "center": ["रिपोर्ट करता है कि प्रेस्ली गेर्बर की मृत्यु के समय वह एक पुनर्वास सुविधा में थे।", "उल्लेख करता है कि मृत्यु का कारण अभी